<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>All the sins you’ve e’er committed,</l><l>Everything you’ve ever done,</l><l>All by God has been forgiven</l><l>Taken care of by God’s Son.</l><l>Struggle not, no; just believe this,</l><l>For His word assures it’s true;</l><l>All you need to do is thank Him</l><l>For all that He’s done for you.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Did you know that all the Bible</l><l>Is a will, a testament?</l><l>Everything that Christ accomplished</l><l>Is for all God’s children meant.</l><l>As His child you are included,</l><l>For His word stands fast and true;</l><l>So by faith you now inherit</l><l>All that He has done for you.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Did you know God has a family?</l><l>Yes, He does, in fact, it’s us.</l><l>That’s why we are here enjoying</l><l>All He is, so marvelous.</l><l>He’s our God and we’re His people,</l><l>Day by day we love Him more;</l><l>We’re so happy and so thankful,</l><l>We just praise Him o’er and o’er.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>All we know is that we love Him,</l><l>We’re so glad for what He’s done;</l><l>We are brought to Him, and we all</l><l>Know the joy of being one.</l><l>We’re so glad that we’re included,</l><l>What a fellowship have we!</l><l>So we’d like to welcome you, friend,</l><l>Into God’s own family.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
